{"id": "c2", "name": "Grammar-constrained decoding for local LLMs", "summary": "Constrain a local model's sampling to a formal grammar (GBNF / JSON schema) so output is guaranteed to parse. Implemented in llama.cpp and the 'outlines' library; eliminates structured-output retries.", "source": "github/example/outlines", "label": "real"}
{"id": "c3", "name": "Capability-scoped tool tokens", "summary": "Agents receive short-lived tokens that grant only specific capabilities (e.g. email.read, memory.write) instead of blanket access, with an explicit forbidden-bypass doctrine. Least-privilege for tool use.", "source": "blog/example/scoped-agents", "label": "real"}
